<h1 dir="auto" data-start="1510" data-end="1555" data-section-id="1tna41u">2. Una persona puede tener muchos vehículos</h1>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1557" data-end="1565">Ejemplo:</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="1567" data-end="1588" data-section-id="11w6ded">Cédula 72.000.000</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1590" data-end="1608">Actualmente tiene:</p>
<ul data-start="1610" data-end="1627">
<li data-start="1610" data-end="1618" data-section-id="1von9js">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1612" data-end="1618">ABC123</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1619" data-end="1627" data-section-id="1xgjcv8">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1621" data-end="1627">XYZ456</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1629" data-end="1653">Pero anteriormente tuvo:</p>
<ul data-start="1655" data-end="1672">
<li data-start="1655" data-end="1663" data-section-id="1uy38bd">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1657" data-end="1663">DEF789</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1664" data-end="1672" data-section-id="1wshfku">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1666" data-end="1672">GHI321</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1674" data-end="1719">No debemos eliminar los vehículos anteriores.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1721" data-end="1745">El sistema debe mostrar:</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="1747" data-end="1785" data-section-id="1twekqh">HISTORIAL DE VEHÍCULOS DEL CLIENTE</h3>
<div dir="auto" class="group TyagGW_tableContainer TyagGW_tableContainerWithTableOfContents"><div tabindex="-1" class="TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1787" data-end="2005" dir="auto" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1787" data-end="1832"><tr data-start="1787" data-end="1832"><th data-start="1787" data-end="1795" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Placa</th><th data-start="1795" data-end="1806" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Relación</th><th data-start="1806" data-end="1814" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Desde</th><th data-start="1814" data-end="1822" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Hasta</th><th data-start="1822" data-end="1832" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1855" data-end="2005"><tr data-start="1855" data-end="1904"><td data-start="1855" data-end="1864" data-col-size="sm">ABC123</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1864" data-end="1878">Propietario</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1878" data-end="1885">2025</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1885" data-end="1894">Actual</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1894" data-end="1904">Activo</td></tr><tr data-start="1905" data-end="1954"><td data-start="1905" data-end="1914" data-col-size="sm">XYZ456</td><td data-start="1914" data-end="1928" data-col-size="sm">Propietario</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1928" data-end="1935">2026</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1935" data-end="1944">Actual</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1944" data-end="1954">Activo</td></tr><tr data-start="1955" data-end="2005"><td data-start="1955" data-end="1964" data-col-size="sm">DEF789</td><td data-start="1964" data-end="1978" data-col-size="sm">Propietario</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1978" data-end="1985">2020</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1985" data-end="1992">2024</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1992" data-end="2005">Histórico</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copiar la tabla" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-3809bd01.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2007" data-end="2038">Así nunca perdemos información.</p>
<hr data-start="2040" data-end="2043">
<h1 dir="auto" data-start="2045" data-end="2093" data-section-id="1urkt8i">3. Y una placa puede tener muchos propietarios</h1>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2095" data-end="2126">Esto es todavía más importante.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2128" data-end="2140">Por ejemplo:</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="2142" data-end="2152" data-section-id="j3g4ty">ABC123</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2154" data-end="2164">Historial:</p>
<div dir="auto" class="group TyagGW_tableContainer TyagGW_tableContainerWithTableOfContents"><div tabindex="-1" class="TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="2166" data-end="2286" dir="auto" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="2166" data-end="2197"><tr data-start="2166" data-end="2197"><th data-start="2166" data-end="2180" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Propietario</th><th data-start="2180" data-end="2188" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Desde</th><th data-start="2188" data-end="2197" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Hasta</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2212" data-end="2286"><tr data-start="2212" data-end="2235"><td data-start="2212" data-end="2220" data-col-size="sm">Pedro</td><td data-start="2220" data-end="2227" data-col-size="sm">2018</td><td data-start="2227" data-end="2235" data-col-size="sm">2021</td></tr><tr data-start="2236" data-end="2259"><td data-start="2236" data-end="2244" data-col-size="sm">María</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2244" data-end="2251">2021</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2251" data-end="2259">2024</td></tr><tr data-start="2260" data-end="2286"><td data-start="2260" data-end="2269" data-col-size="sm">Carlos</td><td data-start="2269" data-end="2276" data-col-size="sm">2024</td><td data-start="2276" data-end="2286" data-col-size="sm">Actual</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copiar la tabla" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-3809bd01.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2288" data-end="2384">Pero <strong data-start="2293" data-end="2350">TRAMISANDER no debe modificar el propietario anterior</strong> cuando se haga un nuevo traspaso.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2386" data-end="2426">Debe crear una nueva relación histórica.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2428" data-end="2460">Por eso la tabla correcta sería:</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="2462" data-end="2497" data-section-id="12l6exl">HISTORIAL_PROPIETARIOS_VEHÍCULO</h3>
<ul data-start="2499" data-end="2609">
<li data-start="2499" data-end="2503" data-section-id="yhmtl1">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2501" data-end="2503">ID</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2504" data-end="2517" data-section-id="1sbp5ra">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2506" data-end="2517">ID vehículo</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2518" data-end="2527" data-section-id="10hw6m4">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2520" data-end="2527">Persona</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2528" data-end="2546" data-section-id="l8x812">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2530" data-end="2546">Tipo de relación</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2547" data-end="2561" data-section-id="3x7oru">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2549" data-end="2561">Fecha inicio</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2562" data-end="2573" data-section-id="l3ars0">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2564" data-end="2573">Fecha fin</p>
</li>
