<p dir="auto" data-start="2576" data-end="2593">Documento soporte</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2594" data-end="2609" data-section-id="o5kecr">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2596" data-end="2609">Observaciones</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2611" data-end="2614">
<h1 dir="auto" data-start="2616" data-end="2678" data-section-id="n5w8d3">4. Pero hay otro punto que acabas de detectar y es excelente</h1>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2680" data-end="2740">El <strong data-start="2683" data-end="2739">contratante del servicio puede no ser el propietario</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2742" data-end="2750">Ejemplo:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2752" data-end="2874">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2754" data-end="2874">Vendedor: Juan<br data-start="2768" data-end="2771">
Comprador: Pedro<br data-start="2789" data-end="2792">
Contratante: María<br data-start="2812" data-end="2815">
Quien paga: María<br data-start="2834" data-end="2837">
Gestor: Carlos<br data-start="2853" data-end="2856">
Vehículo: ABC123</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2876" data-end="2913">Todos pueden ser personas diferentes.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2915" data-end="2987">Por eso <strong data-start="2923" data-end="2986">NO debemos poner solamente un campo "Cliente" en el trámite</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2989" data-end="3003">Debemos crear:</p>
<h2 dir="auto" data-start="3005" data-end="3033" data-section-id="1p1jtir">PARTICIPANTES DEL TRÁMITE</h2>
<div dir="auto" class="group TyagGW_tableContainer TyagGW_tableContainerWithTableOfContents"><div tabindex="-1" class="TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="3035" data-end="3168" dir="auto" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="3035" data-end="3052"><tr data-start="3035" data-end="3052"><th data-start="3035" data-end="3045" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Persona</th><th data-start="3045" data-end="3052" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Rol</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="3063" data-end="3168"><tr data-start="3063" data-end="3082"><td data-start="3063" data-end="3070" data-col-size="sm">Juan</td><td data-start="3070" data-end="3082" data-col-size="sm">Vendedor</td></tr><tr data-start="3083" data-end="3104"><td data-start="3083" data-end="3091" data-col-size="sm">Pedro</td><td data-start="3091" data-end="3104" data-col-size="sm">Comprador</td></tr><tr data-start="3105" data-end="3128"><td data-start="3105" data-end="3113" data-col-size="sm">María</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3113" data-end="3128">Contratante</td></tr><tr data-start="3129" data-end="3148"><td data-start="3129" data-end="3137" data-col-size="sm">María</td><td data-start="3137" data-end="3148" data-col-size="sm">Pagador</td></tr><tr data-start="3149" data-end="3168"><td data-start="3149" data-end="3158" data-col-size="sm">Carlos</td><td data-start="3158" data-end="3168" data-col-size="sm">Gestor</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copiar la tabla" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href=